WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.000
¿Qué tan romántico?

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.080
And hot.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.160
That's hot, okay?

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.960
Hey, Gina.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.440
Gina.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.600
What's up with you?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.880
No time for romance.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.880
Oh, no time

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.680
for romance, really?

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.520
Nice.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.400
No time for romance.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.400
No time for living.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.160
No time for nothing.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.760
You know what?

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.200
You need to forget this

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.520
bloody sucker Spencer

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.800
and start living

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.400
your own life.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.800
It's for you.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.240
Spencer is not a bloodsucker.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:46.720
Oh, really?

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.400
And who is he?

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.200
A werewolf?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.120
No.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.080
He's just a man who

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.480
wanted me to give him

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.600
a child.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.120
Then I found out that I can't,

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.640
so I have no right

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.280
to take away his future.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.840
Long story short, he's an ex.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:06.720
I'm so sorry,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.800
but prince charming

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.240
gave you his card

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.320
and code.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.040
Will you confess

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.320
who's behind all these goodies?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.520
Trust me.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:24.760
Comparing to that bloodsucker,

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.520
Spencer is just a mosquito.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.160
How intriguing.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.000
Red flags are not intriguing.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.920
No, no, no.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.040
Oh my gosh.
